{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Chidekel.</b> For its waters are sharp and light." "<b>Perat.</b> For its waters are fruitful and multiply and make a man bloom. <b>Cush and Asshur.</b> They did not yet exist, and Scripture writes them by the name of the future." "<b>East of Asshur.</b> To the east of Asshur." "<b>That is the Perat.</b> The most important of them all — the one mentioned on account of the Land of Israel."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:15.590593880Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}